# PyInstaller spec files for bundling Python backend on Windows + macOS.
#
# Created in M4. One-folder mode (faster startup, lower antivirus FP rate).
#
# Files:
#   windows.spec  — Windows MSI bundle (no console, ascendo-backend.exe)
#   macos.spec    — universal2 (arm64 + x86_64), .app bundle
#   linux.spec    — optional (Linux uses system Python via .deb dep)
#   hooks/        — custom PyInstaller hooks for Pydantic dynamic imports
#   version_info.txt — Windows .exe metadata
#
# See docs/architecture/0008-distribution-strategy.md
